%% Authentication flows (backend/api/routes_auth.py, frontend/src/context/AuthContext.tsx)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Web console
    participant G as Google Identity Services
    participant API as FastAPI /api/v1/auth
    participant DB as users table

    alt Email + password
        U->>FE: email, password
        FE->>API: POST /login {email, password}
        API->>API: rate limit 15/min/IP
        API->>DB: SELECT user by lower(email)
        API->>API: Argon2id verify
        API-->>FE: {access_token, expires_in, user}
    else Google
        U->>G: choose account (GSI button)
        G-->>FE: ID token (credential)
        FE->>API: POST /google {id_token}
        API->>G: fetch JWKS (cached), verify RS256, aud, iss, email_verified
        API->>DB: find by google_sub, else by email, else create (operator)
        API-->>FE: {access_token, expires_in, user}
    end
    FE->>FE: localStorage surya_token / surya_user
    FE->>API: later requests with Authorization: Bearer
    FE->>API: WebSocket /ws?token=...
    U->>FE: Sign out
    FE->>FE: clear localStorage (no server call)
    Note over API,DB: POST /logout (used by no client) increments token_version,<br/>revoking every token for that user
